<title>SINGAPORE: Elec &amp; Eltek full year net up 33.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Elec &amp; Eltek full year net up 33.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of S$ unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 49.05     vs     36.76</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	   47.62     vs     36.74</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		  5.00     vs	4.50</p>
<p>    Bonus dividend (cents)	  5.00     vs	4.50</p>
<p>Turnover			  311.24     vs    256.77</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)		(3.51)    vs     (1.81)</p>
<p>    Interest on borrowings	 (2.00)    vs     (1.22)</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation   (19.52)    vs    (13.32)</p>
<p>    Operating pre-tax		56.02     vs     40.53</p>
<p>    Tax				  (3.47)    vs     (1.96)</p>
<p>    Div register/pay	  December 10/December 20 1996</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Elec &amp; Eltek International Co Ltd. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
